Notes from the lowering — divergences between this artifact and its L4 source
are disclosed here rather than left to be discovered (R10, R11, §8.4):

- directive 4 did not become a Catala `#[test]` scope: its result type could not be determined — a test scope wraps a call to an @export decision (§8.7)
- directive 5 did not become a Catala `#[test]` scope: its result type could not be determined — a test scope wraps a call to an @export decision (§8.7)

